    "scenesThatPass": [
      "GEORGIANA: ...leave us, please...\nGEORGIANA: I am Georgiana. What's your name?\nGEORGIANA: Shh, there now, you are safe here ...so what do you call your doll?\nGEORGIANA: Surely, it must have a name. Every doll must have a name.",
      "GEORGIANA: Where are you staying?\nBESS: I've rented some rooms in town.\nGEORGIANA: We must meet again.\nBESS: We must.",
      "BESS: This is incredible ...\nGEORGIANA: Yes. There’s the castle in Ireland, Bolton Abbey, Chiswick, Burlington - and Chatsworth, of course, which is much bigger - but this is more …\nGEORGIANA: I am so glad you are here. I have arranged a wonderful start to the season.",
      "GEORGIANA: Hello Mama.\nLADY SPENCER: Hello my dear.\nBESS: We’re so glad you were able to visit, Lady Spencer.\nLADY SPENCER: Are ‘we’ really?",
      "BESS: Whatever is the matter with you? Your behaviour is so out of the ordinary.\nGEORGIANA: I just feel like keeping to myself today..."
    ]
  },
